From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:53:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] wifi: drop prebuilt wpa_supplicant.conf

vendor/samsung/a14 already ships the stock wpa_supplicant.conf with
device-specific SAE/PMF/OCE settings, so installing the generic one
from scsc_wifibt triggers a duplicate target error in kati.

---
 Android.bp | 10 ----------
 1 file changed, 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -34,13 +34,3 @@ cc_library_static {
         "external/libnl/include",
     ],
 }
-
-prebuilt_etc {
-    name: "wpa_supplicant.conf",
-    src: ":wpa_supplicant_conf_gen",
-    sub_dir: "wifi",
-    vendor: true,
-    licenses: [
-        "external_wpa_supplicant_8_license",
-    ],
-}
-- 
2.43.0
